OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 3 MAY
OL,4,G0900FSunday Morning
OL,5,     GSarah Walker chooses uplifting
OL,6,     Gmusic to complement your morning,
OL,7,     Gwhether you're enjoying a quiet
OL,8,     Gcoffee, preparing for Sunday
OL,9,     Glunch or heading into the
OL,10,     Goutdoors.
OL,11,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,12,     GMichael Berkeley's guest is the
OL,13,     Gcameraman and writer James Aldred.
OL,14,G1330FMusic Map
OL,15,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch explores
OL,16,     GWagner's Siegfried Idyll - a
OL,17,     Gpiece written as a birthday
OL,18,     Gpresent for his wife. Featuring
OL,19,     Gmore musical gifts from J.S.
OL,20,     GBach, Bartok and Billie Holiday.
