OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 3 MAY
OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GHannah French explores music-
OL,6,     Gmaking in the city of Madrid from
OL,7,     Gthe early Renaissance up to the
OL,8,     G18th Century, including figures
OL,9,     Gsuch as Victoria, Cabezon,
OL,10,     GScarlatti and Farinelli.
OL,11,G1800FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GLive from Christ Church
OL,13,     GCathedral. Oxford, with music by
OL,14,     GTaverner, Palestrina, Victoria,
OL,15,     GMonteverdi and Buxtehude.
OL,16,G1900FSunday Feature: Finding Florence
OL,17,     FMills
OL,18,     GAllyson Devenish goes in search
OL,19,     Gof 1920s sensation Florence Mills.
